license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible simulations of ticket concentration, historical predictive
  overfitting, and participation under assumed near-miss responses in an
  idealized fair 6/55 lottery. Includes frozen experiment evidence, source
  snapshots, and a recent-frequency prediction baseline.
keywords:
  - lottery simulation
  - probability
  - ticket concentration
  - weighted sampling without replacement
  - overfitting
  - agent-based modeling
  - reproducibility
